# ─── Misc ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.class
*.log
# pubspec.lock IS committed for app projects (Flutter convention);
# `*.lock` is intended to keep Python package-lock.json / yarn.lock out.
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
crashlytics/
# Service-account private keys — real secrets. NOT `firebase*.json`, which
# also swallowed firebase.json / firestore.indexes.json: those are deploy
# config with nothing sensitive in them and belong in the repo, so
# `firebase deploy --only firestore:rules` works on a fresh clone.
firebase-adminsdk-*.json
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
serviceAccountKey.json
# Per-developer download from the Firebase console. Contains the project's
# public Android API key — not a secret, but it is per-project config that
# each developer fetches themselves.
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist
*.tmp
*.bak
# Release APKs — published via GitHub Releases, not committed to git
Shongjog-*.apk
*.apk
!pubspec.lock

# ─── Team-local AI tooling (per-developer, not project code) ─
.agents/
.vercel
.env*
